flowchart TD
    Q[Question, attached context, recent turns] --> A[brok-agent]
    I[(Local index)] --> A
    A --> R[Mask secrets, bound size]
    R --> P{Provider chosen in brok.yml}
    P -- local --> L[Ollama or LM Studio on this machine]
    P -- hosted --> H[Hosted API: this text leaves the machine]
    S[Search, indexing, memory] --> N[Never leave the machine unless sync is configured]
